Kuon\n\nPlease refer to the profile at the end of this document to get an idea of the background and poses, if necessary.\n\nDelivery Format\nPlease use PSD as the file format.\nWe may use only portraits, so we would appreciate it if you could separate the layers for the background, portraits, and signatures.\n\nUsage\nFor use on youtube and various social networking sites.\n\nWe would appreciate your consideration.\n\nProfile\nI am Itakage Kuon, a general otaku type virtual lifer.\nI'm going to spread otaku culture to the world with my comrades through the virtual world.\nI'm going to have a lot of fun with my comrades.\nUsually I deliver: chatting, games, planning", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Koro565656/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/96f797bf/uploads/origins/ca5b2049-307a-4c70-a263-c441f443bbd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7b68e7f9bd11505896d96e3697c0bf3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/96f797bf/uploads/origins/ca5b2049-307a-4c70-a263-c441f443bbd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7b68e7f9bd11505896d96e3697c0bf3, https://si.imgix.net/96f797bf/uploads/origins/ca5b2049-307a-4c70-a263-c441f443bbd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=392fc4fe8ae95c9215d78bdcdc70cde3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/96f797bf/uploads/origins/ca5b2049-307a-4c70-a263-c441f443bbd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3330f4e71dc2194e1671b897c673186e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Excuse my request.\nI would like to request this character (https://imgur.com/a/XsoVMZN).\nI would be happy if the picture has a dark atmosphere and looks like he is grinning at me.\nIf there is any problem, please feel free to cancel the request.\nIf you are interested, please feel free to cancel the request.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Koro565656/works/7", "thumb